# WinUI 3 example build output.
# The repo-root .gitignore already drops bin/ obj/ *.exe *.dll *.obj *.pdb; MSVC and the
# XAML markup compiler additionally write these, which those patterns do not cover.

# Platform intermediate + self-contained unpacked deploy (x64/Debug/<Project>/).
examples/**/x64/
examples/**/Win32/
examples/**/ARM64/

# NuGet restore for the vcxproj (PackageReference).
examples/**/obj/

# Markup-compiler output: *.g.h/.g.hpp, *.xbf, XamlTypeInfo.g.cpp, module.g.cpp, ...
examples/**/Generated Files/

# The markup compiler injects these into the project directory on first build; they are
# byte-identical to the copies under Generated Files/ and are never hand-edited.
examples/**/XamlMetaDataProvider.idl
examples/**/XamlMetaDataProvider.cpp
examples/**/XamlMetaDataProvider.h

# ui-smoke screenshot evidence; regenerated on every run.
.smoke/
